      <title>如何在交流會中介紹自己與夥伴</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202012/introduce-yourself-at-networking-events/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Dec 2020 16:05:02 +0800</pubDate>
